      "role": "user",
      "content": "yeah but that \"small moments\" thing feels like such a lie. like we're just decorating a cell. if the universe doesn't care and nothing we do leaves a permanent mark, then all this effort to \"stay\" and \"breathe\" is just... delaying the inevitable. it feels more like a trap than a choice.",
